.TH "STYLEPROPERTYMAP" "3JS" "August 4, 2026" "JavaScript" "JavaScript Reference Manual"
.SH NAME
StylePropertyMap \- StylePropertyMap
.SH SYNOPSIS
The \f[B]\f[CB]StylePropertyMap\f[B]\f[R] interface of the CSS Typed
Object Model API provides a representation of a CSS declaration block
that is an alternative to \f[CR]CSSStyleDeclaration\f[R].
.RS
.PP
\f[B]Note:\f[R] This interface is only available on the window thread;
unlike other interfaces in this API it cannot be accessed in
\f[CR]Worker\f[R] or \f[CR]Worklet\f[R] contexts.
Worklets receive a read\-only snapshot of an element\(cqs style through
\f[CR]StylePropertyMapReadOnly\f[R].
.RE
.SH INSTANCE PROPERTIES
\f[I]Also inherits properties from its parent interface,
\f[CI]StylePropertyMapReadOnly\f[I].\f[R]
.SH INSTANCE METHODS
\f[I]Also inherits methods from its parent interface,
\f[CI]StylePropertyMapReadOnly\f[I].\f[R]
.TP
\f[B]StylePropertyMap.append()\f[R]
Adds a new CSS declaration to the \f[CR]StylePropertyMap\f[R] with the
given property and value.
.TP
\f[B]StylePropertyMap.clear()\f[R]
Removes all declarations in the \f[CR]StylePropertyMap\f[R].
.TP
\f[B]StylePropertyMap.delete()\f[R]
Removes the CSS declaration with the given property.
.TP
\f[B]StylePropertyMap.set()\f[R]
Changes the CSS declaration with the given property.
